  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(5, 7, 140)\n\n(6, 4, 96)\n\n**Logic:** Third no. = [(First no.) × (Second no.) × 4]\n\n**(5, 7, 140) →**\n\n⇒ [5 × 7 × 4]\n\n⇒ (35 × 4) = 140\n\n**(6, 4, 96) →**\n\n⇒ [6 × 4 × 4]\n\n⇒ (24 × 4) = 96\n\nChecking all the given options:\n\n**1. **(7, 3, 63) →\n\n⇒ [7 × 3 × 4]\n\n⇒ (21 × 4) = 84\n\n**2. **(5, 14, 210) →\n\n⇒ [5 × 14 × 4]\n\n⇒ (70 × 4) = 280\n\n**3.** **(9, 2, 72) →**\n\n⇒ [9 × 2 × 4]\n\n⇒ (18 × 4) = **72**\n\n**4. **(6, 7, 126) →\n\n⇒ [6 × 7 × 4]\n\n⇒ (42 × 4) = 168\n\nHere, **(9, 2, 72) **shows a similar relation to the given set of numbers.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (3)\".",
